{
	"name": "bttn_ux_animation_events",
	"events": [
		{
			"eventType": "comment",
			"text": "HOW TO ADD UX TO BUTTONS:\n1. Include this event sheet in the layout's event sheet (right click -> include event sheet -> bttn_ux_animation_events)\n2. Put button object in 'buttons' family\n\nTO CONFIGURE LOGIC ON BUTTON PRESS (DO AFTER ABOVE):\n1. Set its 'bttn_id' instance variable\n2. Use trigger condition \"System -> on trigger [bttn_id]_pressed\"\n           replace [bttn_id] with whatever you set the bttn_id to\n\nlook at the main_menu_events sheet as an example on how to do it"
		},
		{
			"eventType": "comment",
			"text": "Cooldown necessary so player doesn't accidentally go into another layer when returning from a prev layer"
		},
